The SLC602 ZigBee Wireless Switch provides wireless on/off control with extremely low power consumption. It is easy to install or adhere anywhere in the house.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 and ZLL compliant
- Wireless on/off switch
- Easy to install or adhere anywhere in the house
- Extremely low power consumption
- 2 x AAA batteries, 1-year battery life
- 80mm diameter, 52g
